Awaiting photos - see /PHOTOS-NEEDED.txt for the filenames this folder expects.

One folder for every project photo. Files are named after the project
with a number on the end, and -1 is the one shown on the page:

  <project>-1.jpg   the lead photo, the one visible in the deck
  <project>-2.jpg   the rest, in the order they should be stepped through
  <project>-3.jpg
  ...

The number of photos is whatever exists; a project with one photo shows
as a single photo with no pile behind it.
